dation.org/data/all/federal/2027-tax-brackets/\n\n\"In 2027, the gift tax exclusion will increase to $20,000 per recipient, up from $19,000 in both 2025 and 2026.\"\n\n\"The exclusion is increased to $201,000 from $194,000 for gifts to spouses who are not citizens of the United States.\"\n\nAm I reading this right? I can give my American born friend $20k tax free, but if I was married to a non-citizen I can give $201k tax free? How does this benefit Americans? If I marry an illegal, does this mean I can gift my paycheck to my wife tax free?  Any tax accountants on here that can give me some insight into this?\n\nI'm tired of paying taxes to a country that gives my money away to people that didn't earn it. ", "author": "NotDoneWinning", "created": 1795388372728, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "MJPalazzolo", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Hey IRS. WTF is this shit?", "last_comment_created": 1795406080805, "content": "<p>Found on <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://taxfoundation.org/data/all/federal/2027-tax-brackets/\" target=\"_blank\">https://taxfoundation.org/data/all/federal/2027-tax-brackets/</a></p>\n<p>&quot;In 2027, the gift tax exclusion will increase to $20,000 per recipient, up from $19,000 in both 2025 and 2026.&quot;</p>\n<p>&quot;The exclusion is increased to $201,000 from $194,000 for gifts to spouses who are not citizens of the United States.&quot;</p>\n<p>Am I reading this right? I can give my American born friend $20k tax free, but if I was married to a non-citizen I can give $201k tax free? How does this benefit Americans? If I marry an illegal, does this mean I can gift my paycheck to my wife tax free?  Any tax accountants on here that can give me some insight into this?</p>\n<p>I'm tired of paying taxes to a country that gives my money away to people that didn't earn it.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 22, "score_up": 67, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2124342184937701489", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATomy9HlJ", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 388, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8950591, "raw_content": "", "author": "journalist", "created": 1795353935378, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Twobuck40", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATomy9HlJ.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/WWG1WGA_QQ/status/2124342184937701489", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "\ud83d\udea8 BREAKING: THOUSANDS of right-wing Chileans have SURGED to the streets celebrating tonight's landslide victory of Jose Kast over the Communist candidate in the presidential election. Socialism is being kicked out of power. NATIONALISM! POPULISM! It is rising, EVERYWHERE!", "last_comment_created": 1795394517611, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 40, "score_up": 388, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"twitter": {"quotedTweet": false, "images": false, "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 34, "created": 1795317619000, "id": "2124342184937701489